{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"[Onayl\u0131 mod \u2014 yazma] Bu ara\u00e7 Pushizo\u2019da kay\u0131t olu\u015fturur. Yaln\u0131zca TASLAK olu\u015fturur, hi\u00e7bir mesaj g\u00f6ndermez veya zamanlamaz; API anahtar\u0131nda `mcp:write` kapsam\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r. \u00c7a\u011f\u0131rmadan \u00f6nce kullan\u0131c\u0131dan a\u00e7\u0131k onay al\u0131n. Kampanyay\u0131 `draft` durumunda olu\u015fturur. Kitle segment kimlikleriyle verilir; i\u00e7erik do\u011frudan veya template_id ile. \u00d6rnek i\u00e7erik: {\"headings\":{\"tr\":\"Ba\u015fl\u0131k\"},\"contents\":{\"tr\":\"Metin\"}}.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"app_id":{"description":"App kimli\u011fi (app_\u2026). App\u2019e ba\u011fl\u0131 anahtarda veya varsay\u0131lan app tan\u0131ml\u0131ysa gerekmez.","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"channels":{"description":"\u00f6r. [\"web_push\",\"android_push\",\"ios_push\",\"email\",\"sms\"]","items":{"maxLength":32,"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"type":"array"},"content":{"additionalProperties":{},"description":"Mesaj i\u00e7eri\u011fi (headings/contents/email_subject\u2026).","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"excluded_segments":{"items":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"included_segments":{"description":"Dahil segmentler; bo\u015fsa t\u00fcm aboneler.","items":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"labels":{"items":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":9,"type":"array"},"name":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"template_id":{"maxLength":64,"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"name":"create_campaign_draft","title":"Kampanya tasla\u011f\u0131 olu\u015ftur"}
